arlett now attends community day.","Apples now plays with Peaches on sunny Fridays and attends all festivals if rooming with the player.",".","***Gameplay Changes***","Recolored the shalal shrub, ancient fern and rafflesia.","Simplified the internal code that prevents the mermaid's bracelet, galdoran gem, super starfruit, and aurora vineyard property deed from being gifted.","Increased the rarity of four leaf clovers in the western cindersap forest.","Increased forage spawns in the highlands ruins area during summer and fall.","Increased sea shell spawns at Fable Reef.",".","***Bugs***","Fixed an issue where Treyvon displayed an invisible frame during Scarlett's 6 heart event.","Fixed an issue where Sophia's reading animation didn't work in some instances during community day.","Fixed an issue where Pierre clipped into Caroline during community day.","Fixed an issue where players could gift the galdoran gem.","Fixed an issue where some players couldn't unlock the warp point to Aurora Vineyard if they were rooming with Apples.","Fixed an issue where Apples' became a roommate option upon seeing their 10 heart part 2 instead of part 3.","Fixed an issue where the CJB Cheats secret woods warp teleported players into a cliff.","Fixed an issue where Apples' icon didn't show up on the map if rooming with the player and NPC Map Locations was installed.","Fixed an issue where Lance had incorrect movie film reaction IDs."]},{"version":"1.15.11","date":1751325459,"changelogText":["SVE legendary fish now produce more roe in fish ponds and have pond colors.","Magic Wand relic is now physically handed to the player by Lance instead of appearing in a chest at his Highlands outpost.","Added internal context tags to various SVE objects for better mod compatibility.","Wizard no longer visits the player to start the Enchanted Grove questline on a festival day.","The Frontier Farm minecart quest will now always start the day after the boiler room bundle is completed.","Sophia's special 